# Data Source Rules

- Every academic source adapter must implement the `SourceAdapter` interface.
- Source adapters belong in `lib/sources`.
- Normalize every source result into `NormalizedPaper`.
- Do not leak source-specific response shapes outside the adapter.
- Use `Promise.allSettled` when calling multiple source adapters.
- Do not crash the whole pipeline if one source fails.
- External API calls must use timeout handling.
- External API calls must use retry or graceful failure.
- Respect rate limits.
- Cache repeated API calls when possible.
- Deduplicate papers in this order:
  1. DOI
  2. arXiv ID
  3. Semantic Scholar ID
  4. OpenAlex ID
  5. normalized title
- Do not fetch or parse full PDFs in MVP.
